abstract: >-
  Open-source Agent Skills for trading research and execution: technical analysis, chart patterns,
  market regime, screening, trade planning, position sizing, a pre-trade risk gate, backtesting,
  Monte Carlo simulation, journaling, performance review and paper/live order routing. Zero
  dependencies, works on any market, no API keys required to start.
